The data runs to September 2026 and was fetched on 7 November 2026.

## Unemployment rate in the EU

```{js}
//| label: fig-eu
//| fig-cap: "Unemployment rate, seasonally adjusted, % of the labour force. Source: Eurostat [@eurostat_une_rt_m]."
const el = document.createElement("div");
const { loadAll } = await import("./jobdata.js");
const { euRanking } = await import("./highlights.js");
el.append(euRanking(el, await loadAll()));
return el;
```

